# Portfolio Data Model

- `Category` — Bodas / 15 años (`slug`, `title`, `published`, `sortOrder`).
- `Plan` — belongs to one category (`@@unique([categoryId, slug])`).
- `PlanSection` — bloques de contenido del plan (título, intro, nota, imagen).
- `PlanGalleryImage` — plan gallery assets.
- Never hardcode plan copy in components when reading from DB — use `lib/db/portfolio.ts`.
- Seed with `npm run db:seed`; migrate with `npm run db:migrate`.
